# Project Core
- Stack: python, nicegui, src-tauri.
- Infrastructure: python.

# Style & Best Practices
- Write the absolute minimum code required to satisfy the prompt.
- Implement strictly the happy path. 
- provide simple code.
- Prefer functional components and hooks.
- Use strict typing; avoid the 'any' type.
- Keep components simple small and single-purpose.
- Do NOT add defensive programming checks.
- for python code put all imports at the top of the file
- Write self-documenting code; avoid unnecessary comments
- Maximum function length: 30 lines. Extract helpers aggressively.

# Workflow Rules
- provide simple code , don't provide code for many edge cases.
- Before refactoring core logic, suggest a plan first.
- Security: Never commit API keys.